  <p id="c-nanqishu-046-lushan-huixiao:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-046-lushan-huixiao:p001:m0000" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AA">陸慧曉</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-046-lushan-huixiao:p001:m0004" ref="jss_82r_1ct_AA">叔明</persName>，吳郡吳人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-046-lushan-huixiao:p001:m0014" ref="jss_82r_1ct">萬載</persName>，侍中。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-046-lushan-huixiao:p001:m0021" ref="jss_82r_1ct_A">子真</persName>，元嘉中爲海陵太守。</p>
